OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA chilly start to a dry, bright
OL,6,Fmorning with some sunny spells,
OL,7,Falthough cloud increasing. Outbreaks
OL,8,Fof occasionally heavy rain spread east
OL,9,Fthrough the afternoon. Strengthening
OL,10,Fsoutherly winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FCloudy with further rain at
OL,13,Ftimes this evening and into the night
OL,14,Fsome heavy at times. Becoming drier
OL,15,Flater in the night with a few clear
OL,16,Fintervals.
OL,17,
OL,18,CFriday:FA day of sunny intervals and
OL,19,Fblustery showers these heavier and
OL,20,Fmore frequent across Argyll. Windy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
